### Public health check
GET http://localhost:8080/actuator/health

### Obtain OAuth2 access token (Basic Auth)
### Username: salesforce-client
### Password: local-dev-secret-change-me
POST http://localhost:8080/oauth2/token
Authorization: Basic c2FsZXNmb3JjZS1jbGllbnQ6bG9jYWwtZGV2LXNlY3JldC1jaGFuZ2UtbWU=
Content-Type: application/x-www-form-urlencoded

grant_type=client_credentials&scope=odata.read

### Replace TOKEN with access_token returned above
GET http://localhost:8080/odata/
Authorization: Bearer TOKEN

###
GET http://localhost:8080/odata/$metadata
Authorization: Bearer TOKEN

###
GET http://localhost:8080/odata/CustomerOrders
Authorization: Bearer TOKEN

###
GET http://localhost:8080/odata/CustomerOrders?$filter=CustomerId%20eq%20'CUST-1001'&$top=50&$skip=0
Authorization: Bearer TOKEN

###
GET http://localhost:8080/odata/CustomerOrders('ORD-1001')
Authorization: Bearer TOKEN

###
GET http://localhost:8080/api/orders
Authorization: Bearer TOKEN

###
GET http://localhost:8080/api/orders/customer/CUST-1001
Authorization: Bearer TOKEN

###
GET http://localhost:8080/api/orders/ORD-1001
Authorization: Bearer TOKEN
